# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MONOGAME / MGCB CONTENT PIPELINE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Compiled XNB content — rebuilt by MGCB on every build
Content/bin/
Content/obj/
*.xnb

# IMPORTANT: source assets in Content/ must never be ignored
# (textures, audio, maps, shaders, XML, encyclopaedia data, etc.)

# MGCB editor temp files only — NOT the .mgcb config itself
*.mgb
Content.mgcb~
*.mgcontent

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
